 "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">To build a solid understanding of DLP protocols, I began by initiating in-depth conversations with my manager and several members of the DLP team. I then reached out to the dashboard users to obtain a better understanding of the nuances.</p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 415, "h": 211, "flex": "column|24px|24px|stretch|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 277, "h": 81, "flex": "row|16px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"bg": "rgb(0, 93, 170)", "t": "box", "w": 3, "h": 81, "clip": 1, "kids": [], "empty": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 258, "h": 81, "flex": "column|4px|4px 0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 258, "h": 24, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--ui);font-size:24px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:600\">70+ surveys</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 258, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">participants ranged from auditors, managers, IT staff, VPs, developers and more</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "br": "0px 10px 10px 0px", "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 277, "h": 74, "flex": "row|16px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"bg": "rgb(0, 93, 170)", "t": "box", "w": 3, "h": 74, "clip": 1, "kids": [], "empty": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 258, "h": 74, "flex": "column|4px|4px 0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 258, "h": 24, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--ui);font-size:24px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:600\">18 interviews &amp; users tests</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 258, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">to further identify pain points and iterate solutions</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "br": "0px 10px 10px 0px", "clip": 1}], "br": "8px", "bg": "rgba(0, 93, 170, 0.1)", "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "03-research", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 290, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(0, 93, 170)\">ANALYSIS</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 800, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">How might we help a wide variety of users ranging from technical auditors to VP managers understand the breadth and depth of data loss at RBC?</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">After assessing survey responses, I noticed two main user groups emerging. Internal auditors were more interested in the granular numbers and details of DLP incidents, whereas managers were interested in the higher level trends.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 114, "flex": "row|32px|12px 0px 12px 32px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 364, "h": 90, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px 8px 8px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 22, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\" data-align=\"center\">01</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 300, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Internal Auditors</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 300, "h": 46, "html": "<ul style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">Determine which incidents to audit</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">Obtain information about their assigned incidents</li></ul>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}, {"t": "box", "w": 364, "h": 90, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px 8px 8px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 22, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\" data-align=\"center\">02</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 300, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Managers (of varying jurisdictions)</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 300, "h": 46, "html": "<ul style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">Understand the breadth and depth of data loss within their jurisdiction</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">Prevent future incidents from occurring</li></ul>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "stack": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 543, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 800, "h": 543, "src": "/images/cs/UnSnJgHxHT0OI4ofU5hdyQUbUlU.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "12px"}], "frame": 1, "fill": 1, "br": "12px"}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "05-analysis", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 2000, "flex": "column|32px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 320, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(0, 93, 170)\">KEY DESIGN EXPLORATIONS</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 300, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 80, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Categorizing data into intuitive sections</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">The existing dashboard had 5 pages. 4/5 pages were reported by users to have seemingly arbitrary graphs that were not sorted or clearly defined.</p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 206, "flex": "column|24px|32px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 736, "h": 40, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:600\">Initial Tabs</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 736, "h": 19.5, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 736, "h": 19.5, "src": "/images/cs/rbc-tabs-initial.png", "fit": "fill", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "4.845px"}], "frame": 1, "fill": 1, "br": "4.845px"}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 736, "h": 78, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:600\">Redesigned Tabs</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 736, "h": 54.52, "frame": 1, "br": "0px", "fill": 1, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 746.0, "h": 54.52, "src": "/images/cs/rbc-tabs-redesigned.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [-10.01, 0]}]}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "br": "8px", "bg": "rgb(250, 250, 250)"}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 370, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Advanced filters for auditors</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 100, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">I spoke with first, second, and third line auditors to identify the additional filters that should be added, sorting requirements between \"must-have\", \"nice-to-have\", and \"bonus\".</p><p style=\"margin-top:8px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">A key pain point for auditors is that the dashboard did not have built-in filters for auditors to sift through the cases they need to assess. As a result, most auditors were manually exporting data from the dashboard as a CSV file.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 209, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 800, "h": 209, "src": "/images/cs/7zFrDAm8IERMw4quKFPv5s2E7jg.webp", "fit": "contain", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0]}], "frame": 1, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 930, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">UI redesign to fit within RBC’s design system</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">RBC has a comprehensive design system called RIG. I created two high-fidelity dashboard iterations, and ultimately went with the second one to prioritize simplicity.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 854, "flex": "column|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 415, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-style:italic\">Dashboard iteration #1</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 388, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 388, "src": "/images/cs/4yTtG9QMH3feZayv93GcMFK5c.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "8px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "8px", "sh": "0px 0px 8px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)"}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 415, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-style:italic\">Dashboard iteration #2</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 388, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 388, "src": "/images/cs/k85xCVIb5Ia2FLXM1bZnWNjaF9Y.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "8px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "8px", "sh": "0px 0px 8px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)"}]}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 280, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Standardizing data visualization</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">Many managers, especially ones that oversee data loss at a higher level, first focus on trends before examining numbers. I standardized all graph styles and displayed them based on most interacted with after looking at a heatmap of the existing dashboard.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 200, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 800, "h": 200, "src": "/images/cs/jq5J1vivi0o18P8M5ByyQHYAzS8.webp", "fit": "contain", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0]}], "frame": 1, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "06-iteration", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 480, "flex": "column|32px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 160, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(0, 93, 170)\">REFLECTION &amp; NEXT STEPS</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 120, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77)\">This project was handed off to a team of developers</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">I made sure my design files were developer ready, front-end code was readable and properly structured, as well as created several screen recordings to explain my process and the functionality of the dashboard.</p>", "single": false}]}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 120, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77)\">Make the most of interviews &amp; surveys.</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">I learned that asking open-ended questions and creating space for participants to share stories often revealed deeper motivations than surface-level responses. Pairing quantitative survey data with qualitative interview feedback allowed me to validate patterns while also uncovering nuances that shaped design decisions.</p>", "single": false}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 120, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77)\">Designing for a wide range of users with specific goals.</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">The dashboard had many different users with different (and often contradicting) goals, so it was a challenge to find ways to display information for the users who need it while maintaining a good high level overview of the metrics.</p>", "single": false}]}], "fill": 1, "id": "07-reflection", "reveal": 1, "clip": 1}]}, "accent": "rgb(0, 93, 170)"}